!##### SEXTUPOLES #####
! K2 values calculated from mml Setpoints and HW2PhysicsParams
! K2 = Setpoint(Ampere) * HW2PhysicsParams / L * 2
! Attention: Length of S1 L = 0.21 has to be used for calculating K2
! In elegant S1 has the length L = 0.105 because it is splitted 
! VALUES FROM LOCO "20170328_232127.loco"
S1      : KSEXT, n_kicks="skicks", L=0.105    , K2=53.55252586
S2      : KSEXT, n_kicks="skicks", L=0.16    , K2=-46.38738644
